Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 82

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart P008.2a

Summary: Track-heading observations and forward-biased learning prototype

Description: |
    Collie Kart P008.2a experimental independent learner for MK7 USA Rev2.
    Holds native steering decisions for approximately 390ms while
    observing every 65ms and maintaining the command watchdog.
    Adds checkpoint heading as learning features, with diagnostic indices.
    Full track corridors and next-checkpoint target bearing are NOT implemented.
    Offline supervised Time Trial testing only; physical override enabled.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
